  },
  {
    "pd_explicit_low_distress": "I feel settled, oddly low-key.",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "Whatever's under that, I can't put a name to.",
    "pda_self_consequence_regret": "What I'd regret, if I stay, is all the trips I kept postponing"
